OL,3,GNEWSAGirl starts school after rare
OL,4,Adisorder transplant
OL,5,
OL,6,FA four-year-old girl who spent six
OL,7,Fmonths having hospital treatment for
OL,8,Fone of the UK's rarest genetic
OL,9,Fconditions is now preparing for her
OL,10,Ffirst day at school.
OL,12,FAutumn, from Helperby in North
OL,13,FYorkshire, was diagnosed at 18 months
OL,14,Fold with Hyper-IgE syndrome, a
OL,15,Fcondition which affects the immune
OL,16,Fsystem.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
