OL,3,GNEWSAGirl starts school after rare
OL,4,Adisorder transplant
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe underwent a successful stem cell
OL,7,Ftransplant from a donor in Germany in
OL,8,FDecember and isolated in hospital for
OL,9,Fmore than a month afterwards, with
OL,10,FAutumn now ready to begin the next
OL,11,Fphase of her young life.
OL,13,FLouise, her mother, said: "It was all
OL,14,Freally hard. She wasn't allowed to
OL,15,Fleave the hospital room. We could all
OL,16,Fleave, but we couldn't go and live our
OL,17,Fnormal lives."
